<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <%-include("../../partials/head")%>
    <title>Shipping Policy</title>
    <style>
      .shipping-policy {
        width: 70%;
        padding: 20px 0;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .shipping-policy div {
        padding: 20px 0;
      }

      .shipping-policy h2 {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 30px 0;
      }

      .shipping-policy ul {
        padding: 10px 0 10px 30px;
      }

      .shipping-policy p,
      .shipping-policy li {
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .shipping-policy p {
        padding: 10px 0;
        line-height: 20px;
      }

      .shipping-policy li {
        padding: 5px 0;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <%-include("../../partials/header")%>
    <section class="shipping-policy">
      <h2>SHIPPING POLICY</h2>
      <div class="intro-div">
        <p>
          At Wings Estilo, we are dedicated to delivering your favorite outfits
          to your doorstep with care and efficiency. Whether you're purchasing
          or renting stunning maternity wear, elegant gowns, or other stylish
          outfits, we ensure a smooth and reliable shipping experience. Our
          shipping policy outlines everything you need to know about delivery
          options, timelines, and costs, so you can shop or rent with
          confidence. Thank you for choosing Wings Estilo! If you have any
          questions or need help, our friendly support team is always ready to
          assist.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="destination-div">
        <h3>Shipping Destinations</h3>
        <p>
          Wings Estilo currently delivers across India. Whether you’re in the
          city or a remote area, we strive to bring our beautiful outfits right
          to your doorstep.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pay-method-div">
        <h3>Payment Methods</h3>
        <p>
          we offer secure and convenient payment options to make your shopping
          experience seamless. You can choose from the following methods at
          checkout:
        </p>
        <ul style="font-weight: 600;">
          <li>Debit Cards</li>
          <li>Net Banking</li>
          <li>E-Wallets (such as JioMoney, FreeCharge, etc.)</li>
          <li>UPI</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          All payments are processed through Razorpay, ensuring a safe and
          reliable transaction every time. Shop or rent with confidence knowing
          your payments are in trusted hands.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="delivery-time-div">
        <h3>Order Processing and Delivery Timeframes</h3>
        <p>
          At Wings Estilo, every outfit is handcrafted with love and precision
          to ensure the perfect fit and style. Once you place an order and
          provide your size details, our team begins crafting your outfit.  
        </p>
          <ul>
            <li><span style="font-weight: 600;">Processing Time:</span> Typically, it takes 3–5 business days to prepare your
              order for shipping. </li>
              <li>
                <span style="font-weight: 600;">Delivery Time:</span> Once shipped, your order will be
                delivered within 5–10 business days, depending on your location. 
              </li>
          </ul> 
         <p>Please
          note that processing times may vary slightly during peak seasons or
          for custom requests. Thank you for your patience as we create
          something special just for you!</p>
       
      </div>

      <div class="address-req-div">
        <h3>Address Requirements</h3>
        <p>
          To ensure a smooth delivery, please provide a complete and accurate
          shipping address when placing your order. This should include the
          recipient’s name, house/flat number, street name, city, state, pin
          code, and any helpful landmarks. We recommend adding a valid phone
          number and email address to receive updates about your order. If you
          realize there’s an error in the address, please contact our support
          team within 24 hours of placing your order to make changes.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="guidelines-div">
        <h3>Damaged or Incorrect Shipments & Receiving Order Guidelines</h3>
        <p>
          At Wings Estilo, we take great care to ensure your order arrives in
          perfect condition. However, if you receive a damaged or incorrect
          item, we’re here to help.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <span style="font-weight: 600;">Reporting Issues:</span>  <br>
            Any damage or discrepancy must be reported within 48 hours of
            receiving your order.
            <ul>
              <li>
                Contact us via phone at +91 9171167503 or email at WingsEstilo@gmail.com with details.
              </li>
              <li>
                Include clear photos or a video of the item and packaging as
                proof.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </li>

          <li>
            <span style="font-weight: 600;">Receiving Guidelines:</span>  <br>
            We recommend inspecting your package as soon as it’s delivered. For
            your protection:
            <ul>
              <li>
                Take a photo or record a video while unboxing to document the
                condition of the package and items.
              </li>
              <li>
                Retain the original packaging until the issue is resolved.
              </li>
            </ul>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Our team will review the case promptly and work with you to resolve
          it—whether that means a replacement, repair, or refund. Your
          satisfaction is our priority!
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-info-div">
        <h3>Contact Information</h3>
        <p>
          If you have any questions, concerns, or need assistance with your
          order, feel free to reach out to us. We're here to help!
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>
            <span style="font-weight: 600;">Address:</span>
            <ul>
              <li>Wings Estilo</li>
              <li>
                5, Shopping Center, Fort Rd, near Sai Baba Mandir Road,
                Kherapati Colony, Phool Bagh, Lashkar, Gwalior, Madhya Pradesh
                474002
              </li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span style="font-weight: 600;">Phone numbers:</span>
            <ul>
              <li>+91 9171167503</li>
              <li>+91 8770616089</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span style="font-weight: 600;">Email:</span>
            <ul>
              <li>WingsEstilo@gmail.com</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span style="font-weight: 600;">Customer support hours:</span>  <br>
            <ul>
              <li>Monday to Friday: 11:30 AM – 8:30 PM</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>
    <%-include("../../partials/footer")%>
  </body>
</html>
